Two medium attempts have produced verified solutions; the third oracle call is still running. If medium is defeated, the next prescribed rung is the 502-vertex shipping candidate, whose answer remains the same three-term polynomial.
diff --git a/gen_2304_09666.py b/gen_2304_09666.py
